                                "sense_id": "b8e8f25b-f681-33e1-b48f-2a1fac94680c",
                                "text": "Certainly there is nothing in the letter to obligate the Government to pay for the rehauling of the 3,421 tons of coal from the storage point to the claimant's powerhouse."
